{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bicycles-2603-0255","content_id":"ffe83674-1b27-467f-bb01-1c9286c7ae51","description":"Product Recall for Eovolt Afternoon Twenty V0 Bicycles presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"31cd99d5-b37e-4ccc-8caf-9d7ad09dd0ff","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-05T15:03:11+01:00","id":"31cd99d5-b37e-4ccc-8caf-9d7ad09dd0ff","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-05T15:03:11+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22d71fe13080622db3871a/2603-0255-product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bikes.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Eovolt Afternoon Twenty V0 Bicycles</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries as the welding between the hinge and downtube can weaken over time, causing the frame to break.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by UTO.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/Sports Equipment - Cycles (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Eovolt</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected models</td>\n      <td>Eovolt Afternoon Twenty V0 (EV08-10 V0 / EV08-11 V0 / EV08-12 V0 / EV08-13 V0 / EV08-14 V0)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batches</td>\n      <td>Serial numbers between 31792210820000 and 31792210822800</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>France</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Specific batches of folding bicycle. Products sold from 7th March 2022. Each frame is identified by a serial number located under the bottom bracket. Only frames with an engraved serial number between 31792210820000 and 317922108222800 inclusive are affected.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_31cd99d5-b37e-4ccc-8caf-9d7ad09dd0ff\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a22d71fe13080622db3871a/2603-0255-product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bikes.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries because the welding between the hinge and downtube can weaken over time and repeated use. This could cause the product to fail during use, leading to injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by UTO.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://utobikes.com/en-uk/pages/rappelproduit-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0?srsltid=AfmBOoppDP1iQFOZiMSXMqSCefDU0rDjUqelK305i6qY8DXbGaVIz7kQ\">Product Recall - Eovolt Afternoon Twenty V0</a> for more information and instructions on how to register for a free frame replacement.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0255</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-05T14:03:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-05","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-05T15:03:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bicycles-2603-0255","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bicycles-2603-0255","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bicycles-2603-0255","content_id":"ffe83674-1b27-467f-bb01-1c9286c7ae51","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-05T14:03:56Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Eovolt Afternoon Twenty V0 Bicycles (2603-0255)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eovolt-afternoon-twenty-v0-bicycles-2603-0255","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":